        "content": "**VLAN 55 demo:** 35 direct interfaces + 5 explicitly translated interfaces = 40 matches. Blue rows show **55 \u2192 155** or **55 \u2192 255**. Other ports allowing 155 or 255 remain excluded unless their exact switch/interface has a rule.\n\nTranslations are **directed and interface-scoped**: no automatic reverse mapping, no multi-hop inference. A direct match takes precedence. VLAN names: **1 Default \u00b7 55 Science data \u00b7 77 Management \u00b7 155 Science data \u2014 local A \u00b7 255 Science data \u2014 local B**."
      }
